create project

Usage:
  mdql project add [flags]

Flags:
      --body string        markdown body
      --body-file string   read body from file ('-' for stdin)
      --dry-run            preview without writing
  -h, --help               help for add
      --lead string        person slug
      --name string        required
      --stage string       draft|active|done
      --tags strings

Global Flags:
  -f, --format string   output: table|json|csv|tsv
      --no-sync         skip stale-index check on open
  -q, --quiet           IDs only
      --root string     store root (default ".")
      --schema string   schema file path (default "./schema.yml")
